# Build artifact. Rebuilt with: go build -o system_cliv4.exe .
*.exe
# Cross-compiled for the deployed server. Rebuilt with:
#   GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o system_cliv4_linux_amd64 .
system_cliv4_linux_amd64

# GENERATED SQL — CONTAINS REAL PATIENT DATA.
# Every file in out/ carries patient names, HNs, invoice numbers and amounts for a
# real clinic. These are the artifact of one run, not source; they belong in the
# operator's records, never in version control.
/out/

# Scratch files from investigating a dump (row counts, name comparisons, psql output).
*.tsv
*.txt
!README.txt

# Local dumps. A clinic's export must never be committed.
*.sql
*.js
*.ods
